// Network correction slots, indexed by MEMBER identity (p0.w - 1): two vec4
// per member -- {target.xyz, arrivalTime}, {targetVel.xyz, strengthScale}.
// strengthScale 0 = inactive; 1 = regular snapshot correction (age-ramped,
// ~1.5 s window); >2.5 = hit correction (fixed 0.25 s window, strong) written
// when a server DAMAGE broadcast lands so every client eases the struck
