const float STORM_WAVE_CONTACT_R = 1.6;
const float STORM_WAVE_LOOKAHEAD = 8.0;
const float STORM_WAVE_STAGGER   = 8.0;
// Per-particle cap on grid-chain NODE VISITS across the 27-cell sweep. Chain
// length scales with swarm density (and hash collisions pull far particles in
// too), so an unbounded walk degraded toward O(N^2) at the 131072-member stress
// cap (~25k node hops per particle inside a collapsed clump). The budget
// bounds each thread's whole sweep at a worst case of ~34M hops fleet-wide
// (parallel lanes, latency-cheap); under ordinary densities it never engages,
// and above it steering samples an arrival-order (spatially arbitrary) prefix
// of each chain -- a bounded random neighbourhood, acceptable for flocking.
const int   STORM_MAX_VISITS = 256;

// storm steering needs no pose math — the pose-free storm chunk provides
